Package: argon-oneup-backlight
Version: 1.0.1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: GamingTux <gamingtux@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: ddcci-dkms (>= 0.4.5), i2c-tools
Recommends: linux-headers-rpi-2712 | linux-headers-raspi | linux-headers-arm64 | linux-headers-rpi-v8 | linux-headers-generic
Section: misc
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/GamingTux/argon-oneup-suite
Description: Standard Linux Backlight Driver Integration for Argon ONE UP
 Bridges the internal DDC/CI display on I2C bus 14 to the standard
 Linux /sys/class/backlight subsystem, providing universal hardware
 brightness keys, slider, and OSD support across all desktop environments
 (KDE Plasma, Raspberry Pi OS Labwc/Wayfire, GNOME, XFCE, etc.).
